  "verified_behavior": [
    "Curated installation copies both shell siblings and registers edit/attribution pre-write and pre-command handlers plus edit post-write, post-command and post-read handlers.",
    "Native tool names map to Write, Edit, MultiEdit, Bash and Read; documented file/content arguments reach existing guards.",
    "conversationId is passed through as session_id; no tool_use_id is fabricated.",
    "A failed native PostToolUse with a nonempty error does not invoke the child or change the existing edit baseline.",
    "Real Bash and Windows PowerShell hook subprocesses refuse unread existing files and user changes outside Git, record successful read/write/command flows, and refuse a forbidden commit trailer.",
    "One and multiple mounted-workspace controls preserve the helper's existing process-directory fallback when command Cwd is absent.",
    "The full corrected Antigravity integration module passed all 35 selected tests in the supervised retry."
  ],
